  o Minor bugfixes (microdescriptor cache):
    - Bring last_listed times up to date with the current consensus when
      reloading the cache from disk, before cleaning the cache by those
      same times. Previously a microdescriptor the consensus still listed
      could be dropped as a week stale. Fixes bug 7164; bugfix on
      0.2.3.1-alpha.
    - Refresh last_listed times wherever a consensus becomes current,
      rather than in the individual callers that remembered to. The path
      taken when certificates arrive for a consensus we were already
      holding did not, so a microdescriptor could be listed by the current
      consensus and a week stale at the same time. Fixes bug 7164; bugfix
      on 0.2.3.1-alpha.
